    "values below instead of the menu. Absent, the game boots normally — so a normal build is",
    "completely unaffected and this cannot leak into a player build by accident.",
    "",
    "This is a TEMPLATE. Copy it to REVIEW_BUILD.json to make a review build; the harness does",
    "that for you (tools/tier0_harness/build_review_app.sh). Install it under its own bundle id",
    "so it sits side by side with the real game rather than replacing it.",
    "",
    "EVERY LIGHT VALUE HERE IS UNDERIVED — §6.2 and §4.3 mark them PLACEHOLDER. They are copied",
    "from tools/tier0_harness/harness_config.yaml so the device build and the desktop capture",
    "are lit by the same rig; if they drift, the two stop being comparable."
